      "comment": "MOVE IT GEORGIA (3) drifted back settling but did best work late to finish 5th at Q Lakeside over 550m (30.86). Strong form has emerged from her last run. Has ability and can bounce back. TWISTED TRUTH (8) had been racing well with a Grade 5/6 win three back then placed next time before missing the frame latest at Q Lakeside. Can feature with the right run. SILVER MOON (2) was out of placings last time (35.47) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing fifth and beaten 9 lengths. Has already won two times from this draw. Looks one of the chances. IMPERIAL AUDREY (6) surprised many when in the placings last start - deserves some thought.",
